title: giveQuest
position: -51,128
---
<<set $hasVisited = false>>
BOSS: We've been looking all over the place for <color=red>some apples</color>. 
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "pc">>
    -> For what?
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
        BOSS: We need it for our dish! 
        BOSS: Please! you're the only one that can help!
        BOSS: Will you go find some <color=red> some apples </color> for me?
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "pc">>
            -> sure why not 
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
                <<getPhase NPC "quest_started">>
                BOSS: Great! Thank you!
                <<set $acceptedQuest = true>>
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "return">>
            -> no sorry, I'm busy
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
                <<getPhase NPC "comeback">>
                BOSS: Aw.. thats a shame. 
                <<set $acceptedQuest = false>>
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "return">>

